{"meta":{"id":"tt0082971","type":"movie","name":"Los cazadores del arca perdida","imdb_id":"tt0082971","description":"Año 1936. Indiana Jones es un profesor de arqueología, dispuesto a correr peligrosas aventuras con tal de conseguir valiosas reliquias históricas. Después de una infructuosa misión en Sudamérica, el gobierno estadounidense le encarga la búsqueda del Arca de la Alianza, donde se conservan las Tablas de la Ley que Dios entregó a Moisés. Según la leyenda, quien las posea tendrá un poder absoluto, razón por la cual también la buscan los nazis.","poster":"https://btttr.cc/poster-q/imdb/poster-default/tt0082971.jpg?tag=none&lang=es-MX&rs=IM","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zPACwR32amTNvzId9qyapCWXYDJ.jpg","logo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uD3bP3Ieud33gU1oVbQji9tHfcW.png","genres":["Aventura","Acción"],"releaseInfo":"1981","released":"1981-06-12T12:00:00.000Z","status":"Released","runtime":"115 min","imdbRating":"8.4","country":"United States of America","cast":["Harrison Ford","Karen Allen","Paul Freeman","John Rhys-Davies","Ronald Lacey","Wolf Kahler","Anthony Higgins","Denholm Elliott","Alfred Molina","Vic Tablian","Don Fellows","William Hootkins","George Harris","Fred Sorenson","Anthony Chinn","Eddie Tagoe","Bill Reimbold","Patrick Durkin","Matthew Scurfield","Malcolm Weaver","Sonny Caldinez","Pat Roach","Christopher Frederick","Tutte Lemkow","Ishaq Bux","Kiran Shah","Souad Messaoudi","Terry Richards","Steve Hanson","Frank Marshall"],"director":["Steven Spielberg"],"writer":["Lawrence Kasdan","George Lucas","Philip Kaufman"],"trailers":[{"source":"ep1d88NWhVY","type":"Trailer","name":"Trailer en castellano de Indiana Jones En busca del arca perdida 1981","ytId":"ep1d88NWhVY","lang":"es"},{"source":"0xQSIdSRlAk","type":"Trailer","name":"Paramount Movies Trailer","ytId":"0xQSIdSRlAk","lang":"en"},{"source":"2F5Xt7qU0MY","type":"Trailer","name":"Indiana Jones and the Raiders of the Lost Ark (1981) Original Trailer [FHD]","ytId":